WEBVTT

00:00.640 --> 00:03.020
<b>AUGUST 15, A.D. 2096
11th DAY OF THE COMPETITION</b>

00:30.750 --> 00:33.300
<b>Pixie, where are the parasite dolls?</b>

00:33.590 --> 00:34.760
<b><i>Here.</i></b>

00:36.090 --> 00:40.560
<b><i>The vanguard led by Miyuki will come into contact
with the parasite dolls in about ten minutes.</i></b>

00:41.560 --> 00:45.730
<b><i>So, I'll bring down the first parasite doll
within eight minutes...</i></b>

00:45.730 --> 00:48.810
<b><i>and eliminate the rest within 20.</i></b>

02:26.620 --> 02:29.250
<b>SDF HEADQUARTERS
BRANCH BUILDING</b>

02:30.370 --> 02:32.920
<b>A magician of unknown affiliation
has infiltrated the premises!</b>

02:33.540 --> 02:34.920
<b>Can you show us on the screen?</b>

02:35.250 --> 02:36.170
<b>Yes, sir.</b>

02:38.670 --> 02:43.300
<b>That's the new M.O.V.A.L. Suit
being developed by Major Saeki's people.</b>

02:44.140 --> 02:50.730
<b>So, Major Saeki's covertly sending in
an agent to thwart the experiment!</b>

02:50.730 --> 02:52.610
<b>The intel was true, then?</b>

02:52.610 --> 02:54.730
<b>Send word to Kudou's technicians!</b>

02:54.730 --> 02:59.200
<b>At odds or not, that agent
is a valuable asset who's protecting Japan.</b>

03:00.070 --> 03:04.070
<b>Tell them that they're permitted to fire back
but not to end up killing him.</b>

03:04.070 --> 03:08.040
<b>Yes, sir. I will order them
not to inflict any fatal wounds on him.</b>

03:14.540 --> 03:15.460
<b><i>There it is.</i></b>

03:18.920 --> 03:20.300
<b><i>It's fast!</i></b>

03:22.720 --> 03:24.180
<b><i>That reaction speed...</i></b>

03:24.510 --> 03:27.180
<b><i>Don't tell me it's a female-type
mechanical soldier!</i></b>

03:27.180 --> 03:29.060
<b><i>So, they're still under development!</i></b>

03:35.020 --> 03:39.570
<b><i>This speed and the information body's rough build
make me think it's a Singular Acceleration-Type.</i></b>

03:39.570 --> 03:41.320
<b><i>No, this is telekinesis!</i></b>

03:46.870 --> 03:49.040
<b><i>This is another Weight-Type Magic spell.</i></b>

03:49.040 --> 03:51.960
<b><i>Just as I suspected, this primitive
magic sequence is telekinesis.</i></b>

03:52.250 --> 03:55.420
<b><i>So, the parasite dolls are using
psychic abilities as their weapons, huh?</i></b>

04:05.680 --> 04:06.640
<b><i>Now's my chance!</i></b>

04:08.600 --> 04:09.850
<b><i>Activate, Regrowth.</i></b>

04:10.640 --> 04:12.850
<b><i>Loyalty Programming Spell copied.</i></b>

04:22.150 --> 04:26.820
<b><i>Now that it's losing Psions, the parasite will be
released from the Loyalty Programming Spell.</i></b>

04:27.160 --> 04:28.950
<b><i>Activate, Regrowth!</i></b>

04:29.540 --> 04:34.500
<b><i>Using the Loyalty Programming Spell I just copied
to relink the parasite to the gynoid!</i></b>

04:35.370 --> 04:37.960
<b><i>Injecting a minute amount of Psions...</i></b>

04:37.960 --> 04:42.630
<b><i>will seal the parasite inside the gynoid
and put it into hibernation mode.</i></b>

04:47.050 --> 04:50.390
<b><i>The parasite is now in total hibernation.</i></b>

04:51.020 --> 04:53.810
<b><i>I had to play that by ear, but it worked.</i></b>

04:54.190 --> 04:57.190
<b><i>What the master told me yesterday
sure came in handy.</i></b>

04:58.110 --> 05:00.900
<b><i>Apparently, no matter who the magician is,
he never forgets...</i></b>

05:00.900 --> 05:04.610
<b><i>what he's defined as the object
of his protection or destruction.</i></b>

05:04.610 --> 05:09.990
<b><i>And if the puppet breaks that rule,
he'll punish it and seal it away.</i></b>

05:09.990 --> 05:15.920
<b><i>He said everything up to that Sealing Spell
was one single Controlling Spell.</i></b>

05:17.790 --> 05:18.830
<b>Pixie...</b>

05:18.830 --> 05:20.790
<b>Where's the nearest parasite doll?</b>

05:21.380 --> 05:26.680
<b><i>Three parasite dolls are now approaching
from two and eleven o'clock.</i></b>

05:53.080 --> 05:55.790
<b>No way! Is this guy really a human?</b>

05:56.410 --> 05:59.670
<b>What the hell is his body made of?</b>

05:59.670 --> 06:03.800
<b>It's not even a matter of being tough
or having a high tolerance for pain.</b>

06:05.050 --> 06:06.800
<b>Mahesvara...</b>

06:07.630 --> 06:08.680
<b>What?</b>

06:09.720 --> 06:14.350
<b>Are you aware of the combat magician
called "Mahesvara" by the enemy forces...</b>

06:14.350 --> 06:19.650
<b>during the Okinawa Defense Battle four years ago
as well as last year's Yokohama Disturbance?</b>

06:20.060 --> 06:21.520
<b>I've heard about him.</b>

06:21.520 --> 06:23.770
<b>He could annihilate
a mobile weapon with a single blow,</b>

06:23.770 --> 06:26.240
<b>and no matter what kind
of attack he received,</b>

06:26.240 --> 06:29.200
<b>he'd revive the next second
as if nothing had happened.</b>

06:29.200 --> 06:30.320
<b>You don't think...</b>

06:30.700 --> 06:35.580
<b>By all indications, Mahesvara is most likely
a magician with close ties to Major Kazama.</b>

06:37.040 --> 06:42.710
<b>Why would a monster like that bother
to show up at some high school competition?</b>

07:02.480 --> 07:04.360
<b>Subaru, what's wrong?</b>

07:04.360 --> 07:05.480
<b>Look at that.</b>

07:09.200 --> 07:10.990
<b>That's a combat gynoid, right?</b>

07:12.070 --> 07:15.490
<b><i>Brother must've brought that one down for us.</i></b>

07:15.950 --> 07:18.500
<b>Looks like it's been deactivated.</b>

07:18.500 --> 07:22.250
<b>You think they missed it when they were
retrieving the machines from their last test?</b>

07:22.960 --> 07:26.710
<b>Either way, since it's not moving,
we shouldn't have to worry about it.</b>

07:26.710 --> 07:30.840
<b>They might've left it
to make us suspicious and slow us down.</b>

07:30.840 --> 07:31.880
<b>Well, then?</b>

07:31.880 --> 07:35.390
<b>We're moving on
before we lose any more time!</b>

07:42.770 --> 07:45.440
<b><i>It's taking longer than I'd planned.</i></b>

07:45.770 --> 07:50.280
<b><i>I guess I've got a grace period of ten minutes
or so before Miyuki's the first to catch up.</i></b>

08:02.620 --> 08:03.830
<b><i>That's the tenth one!</i></b>

08:18.970 --> 08:20.310
<b><i>Eleventh!</i></b>

08:29.570 --> 08:31.400
<b><i>And this is Number 12!</i></b>

08:36.410 --> 08:38.160
<b><i>Master, they're coming.</i></b>

08:40.330 --> 08:42.370
<b><i>Four to go.</i></b>

08:43.460 --> 08:45.370
<b>Four parasite dolls remaining!</b>

08:46.460 --> 08:48.500
<b>I don't believe this guy!</b>

08:48.880 --> 08:53.630
<b>Still, the remaining dolls
are the maximum spec units, the Prime Four!</b>

08:54.380 --> 08:56.470
<b>He may be Mahesvara...</b>

08:56.470 --> 08:58.680
<b>but he's in
for a rude awakening!</b>

09:02.310 --> 09:04.020
<b>THE IRREGULAR
AT MAGIC HIGH SCHOOL
STEEPLECHASE PART IV</b>

09:10.650 --> 09:11.440
<b>Over there, huh?</b>

09:20.700 --> 09:21.790
<b><i>So fast!</i></b>

09:21.790 --> 09:25.920
<b><i>In terms of raw speed, it's on par
with Erika's Self-Acceleration Spell!</i></b>

09:26.290 --> 09:27.000
<b><i>But...</i></b>

09:32.800 --> 09:34.220
<b><i>That's one for starters!</i></b>

09:37.180 --> 09:38.050
<b>What?</b>

10:02.120 --> 10:03.950
<b><i>They're good at teamwork!</i></b>

10:06.910 --> 10:09.210
<b><i>Master, there's an attack coming from the right.</i></b>

10:13.710 --> 10:15.800
<b><i>Fifty seconds until
replenishment is complete.</i></b>

10:15.800 --> 10:19.340
<b><i>Slashing attack from the left.
Please dodge one meter to the right.</i></b>

10:22.760 --> 10:25.390
<b>Pixie, you can tell
how the enemy's going to attack?</b>

10:25.930 --> 10:27.350
<b><i>Yes, Master.</i></b>

10:27.810 --> 10:30.400
<b><i>I am able to hear what they're saying.</i></b>

10:30.690 --> 10:32.060
<b><i>What they're saying?</i></b>

10:32.060 --> 10:35.070
<b><i>Aren't they moving of their own accord?</i></b>

10:35.070 --> 10:37.490
<b><i>Here comes a shell.
It's aimed at your head.</i></b>

10:44.240 --> 10:48.410
<b><i>Those four units are constantly exchanging
thoughts while on the move.</i></b>

10:48.410 --> 10:49.670
<b>So, that's what's going on?</b>

10:51.920 --> 10:52.880
<b>Pixie...</b>

10:52.880 --> 10:55.000
<b>Relay the enemy's conversation to me!</b>

10:55.000 --> 10:56.550
<b><i>Understood.</i></b>

11:03.550 --> 11:07.560
<b>I don't get it! All of a sudden,
the Prime Four's attacks are missing their marks!</b>

11:40.090 --> 11:41.720
<b>That's ridiculous!</b>

11:44.800 --> 11:47.850
<b><i>Slashing attack, right hand,
right leg, left leg.</i></b>

12:04.910 --> 12:06.330
<b><i>Master, behind you.</i></b>

12:36.980 --> 12:39.440
<b><i>Congratulations, Master.</i></b>

12:39.440 --> 12:41.150
<b>Pixie, I owe you one.</b>

12:41.900 --> 12:44.780
<b>My work is done now.</b>

12:44.780 --> 12:48.030
<b>I'll leave the cleanup to someone else.</b>

12:59.000 --> 13:00.050
<b>That's the goal!</b>

13:04.050 --> 13:05.050
<b><i>I got a late start!</i></b>

13:20.940 --> 13:24.570
<b>D-Did they have to make this part
like a military drill?</b>

13:25.110 --> 13:26.280
<b>I'm sorry!</b>

13:26.280 --> 13:27.700
<b>I'll be going on ahead!</b>

13:28.570 --> 13:31.950
<b>You're so heartless!</b>

13:39.000 --> 13:40.460
<b>FIRST HIGH SCHOOL</b>

13:53.350 --> 13:55.770
<b><i>He made such short work of the Prime Four!</i></b>

13:56.230 --> 13:58.060
<b><i>We've got to retrieve them
right away!</i></b>

13:58.060 --> 14:01.190
<b><i>So long as we have the experiment data,
nothing else matters!</i></b>

14:08.700 --> 14:09.820
<b>What's this?</b>

14:10.200 --> 14:11.240
<b>Is it gas?</b>

14:11.240 --> 14:12.740
<b>No, it's magic!</b>

14:13.490 --> 14:19.250
<b>Colonel Sakai as well as your entourage...
I have come to extend an invitation to you.</b>

14:19.250 --> 14:19.960
<b>Who are you?</b>

14:24.920 --> 14:28.220
<b>I'm inviting you
right into the realm of dreams.</b>

14:43.020 --> 14:46.610
<b>Everyone, good work again today.</b>

14:47.400 --> 14:52.990
<b>Although on the surface,
the parasite doll experiment ended in failure...</b>

14:52.990 --> 14:56.120
<b>look how much they made Mahesvara struggle.</b>

14:57.120 --> 15:03.000
<b>Surely, that left a strong impression
on those considering the military use of magic.</b>

15:06.380 --> 15:12.720
<b>By tomorrow, those who've been scheming
to draft young magicians will be overthrown.</b>

15:12.720 --> 15:14.760
<b>Along with the Traditionalists.</b>

15:14.760 --> 15:18.390
<b>That, too, should be considered
a significant feat.</b>

15:19.810 --> 15:21.400
<b>No, it won't be tomorrow.</b>

15:22.480 --> 15:24.150
<b>Kazama...</b>

15:24.820 --> 15:27.030
<b>As well as General Saeki...</b>

15:27.030 --> 15:30.150
<b>It's been a long time,
hasn't it, General Kudou?</b>

15:30.780 --> 15:32.700
<b>What's all this all of a sudden?</b>

15:32.700 --> 15:34.910
<b>This is a private gathering.</b>

15:35.870 --> 15:38.910
<b>Unfortunately, I can't show you any hospitality.</b>

15:39.290 --> 15:43.130
<b>We're well aware
this is an unexpected visit.</b>

15:43.500 --> 15:48.050
<b>As soon as you accept our gift,
we'll be taking our leave.</b>

15:48.840 --> 15:50.340
<b>Gift?</b>

15:56.680 --> 16:02.350
<b><i>I'm Colonel Sakai
of the JDF General Headquarters.</i></b>

16:02.900 --> 16:07.360
<b><i>I met with the current head
of the Kudou Family, Makoto Kudou...</i></b>

16:07.360 --> 16:12.110
<b><i>and pushed for the autonomous magic weapons
to be field-tested during the Nine Schools Competition.</i></b>

16:15.700 --> 16:19.250
<b>So, Sakai's fallen into your clutches?</b>

16:19.540 --> 16:22.830
<b>Not that we were the ones who captured him.</b>

16:23.330 --> 16:28.130
<b>I wonder if you'd mind
telling me who did capture him.</b>

16:28.590 --> 16:32.760
<b>I obtained this audio data
from the Yotsuba Family.</b>

16:35.140 --> 16:36.800
<b>Maya, huh?</b>

16:36.800 --> 16:42.640
<b>But of course, the Yotsubas would never allow
anyone to lay a hand on their family.</b>

16:42.640 --> 16:44.520
<b>I wouldn't say that.</b>

16:45.520 --> 16:47.150
<b>What do you mean by that?</b>

16:47.480 --> 16:54.410
<b>Ms. Yotsuba provided me with this audio data
on condition that it never be made public.</b>

16:56.530 --> 17:02.710
<b>Ms. Yotsuba's goal is to purge
the Anti-Great Asian Alliance hardliners led by Sakai.</b>

17:02.710 --> 17:08.880
<b>So long as we agreed to deal with the aftermath
and to keep the data itself under wraps.</b>

17:08.880 --> 17:12.670
<b>Those were Ms. Yotsuba's terms
for letting me have this data.</b>

17:13.550 --> 17:15.220
<b>I see.</b>

17:15.220 --> 17:19.430
<b>So, Sakai and his cohorts managed
to get on that person's wrong side.</b>

17:20.060 --> 17:25.440
<b>So, now that you have that data,
what are you planning to do with it?</b>

17:25.440 --> 17:31.320
<b>General Kudou, the JDF no longer intends
to force magicians to serve as weapons.</b>

17:33.110 --> 17:37.360
<b>If you wish, I'm even willing
to stake this gray head on that.</b>

17:37.780 --> 17:42.830
<b>No magician will ever be driven
onto a battlefield against his or her will.</b>

17:44.080 --> 17:47.710
<b>That also goes for your grandson and for him.</b>

17:49.710 --> 17:51.090
<b>You...</b>

17:51.090 --> 17:54.220
<b>Are you telling me to retire?</b>

17:54.550 --> 17:58.800
<b>It's true that the parasite dolls
are sure to become useful weapons.</b>

17:58.800 --> 18:01.350
<b>As long as they're not mishandled.</b>

18:01.850 --> 18:03.810
<b>Ten years ago...</b>

18:03.810 --> 18:08.060
<b>you never would've misused them this way.</b>

18:08.690 --> 18:13.280
<b>Please let us handle the rights
of the magicians in the military.</b>

18:13.690 --> 18:17.530
<b>We won't allow what you fear to ever happen.</b>

18:22.620 --> 18:24.540
<b>I see.</b>

19:57.130 --> 20:00.010
<b>AUGUST 16, A.D. 2096</b>

20:00.340 --> 20:02.510
<b><i>The target is heading for the West Gate!</i></b>

20:02.510 --> 20:04.090
<b>He has the geographical advantage.</b>

20:04.090 --> 20:06.510
<b>Make sure there's more than three
of you when you corner him.</b>

20:06.890 --> 20:08.520
<b><i>I have eyes on the target!</i></b>

20:09.430 --> 20:10.520
<b>What happened?</b>

20:10.520 --> 20:12.560
<b><i>There's something that looks like a dog—</i></b>

20:14.650 --> 20:17.440
<b>He's more formidable
than we thought, isn't he, Boss?</b>

20:17.440 --> 20:21.530
<b>He's a big shot who's been stirring
things up in this country all this time.</b>

20:21.530 --> 20:23.910
<b>No way is his individual power paltry.</b>

20:24.240 --> 20:29.410
<b>I believe you said
you'd be sending us Master Tatsuya Shiba.</b>

20:29.700 --> 20:33.290
<b>Capture Gongjin Zhou before he gets here!</b>

20:34.330 --> 20:38.800
<b>Shouldn't we wait for Master Fumiya
and Master Tatsuya to arrive?</b>

20:39.630 --> 20:42.050
<b>What on earth is Ms. Maya thinking?</b>

20:42.590 --> 20:45.680
<b>We should never
use that here.</b>

20:45.680 --> 20:47.180
<b>In fact...</b>

20:47.180 --> 20:49.930
<b>it shouldn't even be let outside!</b>

20:50.680 --> 20:53.810
<b>It's the embodiment of the Yotsubas' sins.</b>

20:53.810 --> 20:57.270
<b>The only way we can atone for it...</b>

20:57.270 --> 21:00.070
<b>is to lock it up within the Yotsuba Clan.</b>

21:05.410 --> 21:07.950
<b>I'll go. Take over for me.</b>

21:07.950 --> 21:09.660
<b>Yes, Boss!</b>

21:16.210 --> 21:18.750
<b>It's all over, Gongjin Zhou.</b>

21:21.710 --> 21:23.090
<b>Well, well...</b>

21:23.380 --> 21:27.470
<b>To think that the head of the Kurobas,
the even darker branch of the Yotsubas...</b>

21:27.470 --> 21:30.350
<b>would appear
for a mere bit player like myself...</b>

21:30.810 --> 21:34.100
<b>You give me too much credit, I see.</b>

21:35.020 --> 21:37.610
<b>I wouldn't call it that.</b>

21:38.110 --> 21:39.610
<b>Founding Blanche...</b>

21:39.940 --> 21:42.110
<b>No-Head Dragon's work
behind the scenes...</b>

21:42.400 --> 21:45.110
<b>training the Great Asian Alliance's
Special Ops unit...</b>

21:45.530 --> 21:47.570
<b>smuggling the parasite dolls...</b>

21:48.530 --> 21:51.620
<b>I'm impressed that you did
all that on your own.</b>

21:52.500 --> 21:56.170
<b>All I did was extend a helping hand.</b>

21:56.170 --> 21:59.880
<b>Those are all things that would've happened
eventually even without me.</b>

22:00.460 --> 22:02.380
<b>It's a nuisance.</b>

22:02.380 --> 22:05.130
<b>Turning "eventually" into "now."</b>

22:06.180 --> 22:10.930
<b>At this distance, you couldn't escape
using your specialty, Ghost Walker.</b>

22:10.930 --> 22:13.310
<b>Give it up, Gongjin Zhou.</b>

22:13.310 --> 22:14.770
<b>You're right.</b>

22:14.770 --> 22:17.560
<b>Not with you practically in my face.</b>

22:17.850 --> 22:18.980
<b>So...</b>

22:18.980 --> 22:21.900
<b>I'm going to inflict a little pain on you.</b>

22:21.900 --> 22:22.530
<b>Ji!</b>

22:22.780 --> 22:24.190
<b>Barking Celestial Hound!</b>

22:27.150 --> 22:28.200
<b><i>What?</i></b>

22:30.910 --> 22:32.370
<b>My, my...</b>

22:32.370 --> 22:35.660
<b>It took me ten years
to create this.</b>

22:36.080 --> 22:41.540
<b>Well, I suppose getting Mitsugu Kuroba's arm
in return makes it a fair enough trade.</b>

22:44.380 --> 22:45.340
<b>Dad!</b>

22:47.420 --> 22:48.590
<b>Big Bro Tatsuya!</b>

22:49.680 --> 22:50.800
<b>Stop!</b>

22:50.800 --> 22:52.600
<b>I won't be beholden to you.</b>

22:52.600 --> 22:54.850
<b>Dad, what are you talking about?</b>

22:54.850 --> 22:56.770
<b>It may displease you...</b>

22:56.770 --> 23:00.810
<b>but leaving you in that state
would only make Fumiya and Ayako sad.</b>

23:08.490 --> 23:09.780
<b>Mr. Kuroba...</b>

23:09.780 --> 23:12.240
<b>For you to sustain such a severe injury...</b>

23:12.830 --> 23:15.870
<b>What kind of magic did Gongjin Zhou use?</b>

23:16.450 --> 23:17.620
<b>I don't know.</b>

23:17.960 --> 23:21.540
<b>Gongjin Zhou said
"Barking Celestial Hound"...</b>

23:21.880 --> 23:24.250
<b>but there's no way that's its name.</b>

23:24.840 --> 23:27.760
<b>So, it's a type of Compound-Form Magic?</b>

23:30.130 --> 23:32.510
<b>It sounds like
quite a troublesome opponent.</b>

23:36.390 --> 23:40.020
<b>THE IRREGULAR
AT MAGIC HIGH SCHOOL
ANCIENT CITY INSURRECTION PART I</b>
